{"4127880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terra Division", "steam_appid": 4127880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Division: RTS/FPS hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, where will you be most needed? Expanding your economy at a crucial moment, or taking part in the assault to break the enemy line? <i>Terra Division</i> constantly presents you with this compelling choice, creating a dynamic and deeply rewarding strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your army in realtime</strong> <br>Defend your outposts, manage your economy, and command vast armies from an classic RTS perspective. Outthink and outmaneuver your enemy with complex strategies, combined arms tactics, and superior base management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.poster.avif?t=1771966286\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.webm?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.mp4?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in First-Person</strong>  <br>Take direct control of any unit on the battlefield. Press a key to become a front-line soldier, a powerful mech pilot, or a tankman. Use your raw FPS skills to aim deadly weapons and activate unique unit abilities at the perfect moment. Your aim matters as much as your strategic plan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/7ec4d6e9fab4e69b27f03c450288cd78.poster.avif?t=1771966286\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/7ec4d6e9fab4e69b27f03c450288cd78.webm?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/7ec4d6e9fab4e69b27f03c450288cd78.mp4?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promote and empower your forces</strong>  <br>Your troops are not expendable. They are the elite of the United Earth Federation. Units gain veterancy through combat, unlocking a deep promotion and upgrade system. Transform a basic rifleman into a veteran with advanced gear. Forge your own personalized, unstoppable elite force.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/a9ff0bb6c4797c3d4ea685fa7a70205c.poster.avif?t=1771966286\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/a9ff0bb6c4797c3d4ea685fa7a70205c.webm?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/a9ff0bb6c4797c3d4ea685fa7a70205c.mp4?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your command style is your weapon. Save the humanity for the United Earth Federation!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Division: RTS/FPS hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, where will you be most needed? Expanding your economy at a crucial moment, or taking part in the assault to break the enemy line? <i>Terra Division</i> constantly presents you with this compelling choice, creating a dynamic and deeply rewarding strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your army in realtime</strong> <br>Defend your outposts, manage your economy, and command vast armies from an classic RTS perspective. Outthink and outmaneuver your enemy with complex strategies, combined arms tactics, and superior base management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.poster.avif?t=1771966286\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.webm?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/b1c0b989a105442d56ed8e44c7a86603.mp4?t=1771966286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in First-Person</strong>  <br>Take direct control of any unit on the battlefield. Press a key to become a front-line soldier, a powerful mech pilot, or a tankman. Use your raw FPS skills to aim deadly weapons and activate unique unit abilities at the perfect moment. Your aim matters as much as your strategic plan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/7ec4d6e9fab4e69b27f03c450288cd78.poster.avif?t=1771966286\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta